# `account.login`

Start a PKCE login — returns the browser auth URL + a state_id.

**Policy** — command `[C2_ELEVATED]`. Capability `ship.account.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `redirect_uri` | `string` |

## Returns

`LoginStarted` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `state_id` | `string` |
| `browser_url` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call account.login --json '{ "redirect_uri": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "state_id": "st_a1b2c3d4",
  "browser_url": "https://api.getship.dev/v1/auth/cli?code_challenge=Xq9&code_challenge_method=S256&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A51763%2Fcallback&state=st_a1b2c3d4"
}
```
